# PowerCore Chrome fonts

Primary UI type for PowerCore branded products is **Inter-class**.

## Locked stack

- UI: `Inter` → `DM Sans` → `Roboto` → `system-ui`
- Mono: `Cascadia Code` → `JetBrains Mono` → `Consolas`

## Do

- CSS: `var(--pc-font-ui)` from PowerCore Chrome tokens
- Tk: `ui_font()` / `mono_font()` from `tray.powercore_chrome`
- Web: load Inter (or DM Sans); body stack starts with `Inter`

## Do not

- Default new PowerCore screens to Segoe-first / IBM Plex-first stacks
- Hardcode font families in widgets — use the shared resolver / tokens

Canonical detail: `powercore-ops/design/powercore-chrome.fonts.md`
